00:08:51.375 --> 00:08:53.458
and I had some Hall of Famers
even told me—they was like

00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:55.792
"Man, you gonna mess up
these opportunities."

00:08:55.792 --> 00:08:58.000
You know, for me,
I'm just like Chad, you know?

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.917
Money comes and goes.

00:08:59.917 --> 00:09:03.625
If I had to, you know,
if I'm put in a situation

00:09:03.625 --> 00:09:06.625
